  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nStep on board and you’ll instantly fall in love with every inch of this yacht. From the lavish exteriors designed by SPLO Yachts. Design to the lush interiors that spell out comfort and luxury, you will automatically feel at home. She comes with 1 luxurious cabin with an en-suite bathroom and a king sized bed. Perfect for a couple to spend an overnight trip exploring the Andaman Sea. Moreover, Chowa is the perfect yacht for momentous celebrations. Its spacious deck provides plenty of opportunities for fun and entertainment, where large groups can celebrate special occasions with style. And with complete facilities and a VIP crew that caters to your every whim, get to enjoy your party yacht charter on Chowa.",
